OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABritish Empire Award for parish
OL,4,Avolunteer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis Excellency Lieutenant General Sir
OL,7,FRichard Cripwell said: "Mr Gregg's
OL,8,Fsustained commitment, practical
OL,9,Fleadership, and tireless work ethic
OL,10,Fhave left an enduring legacy for not
OL,11,Fonly the parish and its parishioners
OL,12,Fbut Guernsey as a whole.
OL,14,F"It is an honour to present him with a
OL,15,FBritish Empire Award on behalf of the
OL,16,Fking."
